#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:1
msgid "Set up your taxpayer profile"
msgstr "Configura el teu perfil de contribuent"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A profile holds the facts about one taxpayer that every `aeat app` "
"command reads and updates. Set one up before you import transactions, "
"calculate a {term}`modelo`, or export a filing."
msgstr ""
"Un perfil conté les dades d'un contribuent que cada ordre `aeat app` "
"llegeix i actualitza. Configura'n un abans d'importar transaccions, "
"calcular un {term}`modelo` o exportar una presentació."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:7
msgid ""
"A profile is local. Creating, editing, showing, exporting, or importing a"
" profile never submits anything to the Agencia Estatal de Administración "
"Tributaria (AEAT). Cadrumo builds and verifies your filing on your "
"machine; you upload it yourself."
msgstr ""
"Un perfil és local. Crear, editar, mostrar, exportar o importar un perfil"
" mai no presenta res a l'Agencia Estatal de Administración Tributaria "
"(AEAT). Cadrumo construeix i verifica la teva presentació a la teva "
"màquina; tu la puges."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:12
msgid ""
"If you haven't installed Cadrumo and run the `aeat` command yet, start "
"with the [quickstart](quickstart.md), then come back here."
msgstr ""
"Si encara no has instal·lat Cadrumo ni has executat l'ordre `aeat`, "
"comença per la [guia ràpida](quickstart.md) i després torna aquí."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:16
msgid "What the active profile means"
msgstr "Què significa el perfil actiu"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:18
msgid ""
"The active profile is the taxpayer context for `aeat app` commands. While"
" a profile is active, commands such as ledger import, transaction "
"classification, modelo calculation, export, and local filing history read"
" and update that profile's data."
msgstr ""
"El perfil actiu és el context de contribuent per a les ordres `aeat app`."
" Mentre un perfil és actiu, les ordres com ara la importació al ledger, "
"la classificació de transaccions, el càlcul de modelos, l'exportació i "
"l'historial de presentacions local llegeixen i actualitzen les dades "
"d'aquell perfil."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:23
msgid ""
"Keep one profile per taxpayer. Add a second profile when you prepare "
"filings for another taxpayer, separate a test profile from a real one, or"
" restore a copy under a different name. To understand why the tool is "
"local-first and human-gated, see the [explanation "
"guides](../explanation/index.md)."
msgstr ""
"Mantén un perfil per contribuent. Afegeix un segon perfil quan preparis "
"presentacions per a un altre contribuent, separis un perfil de proves "
"d'un de real, o restauris una còpia amb un nom diferent. Per entendre per"
" què l'eina és local abans que res i controlada per una persona, consulta"
" les [guies d'explicació](../explanation/index.md)."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:28
msgid ""
"List your profiles with `aeat config profile list`, see which one is "
"active, add a second taxpayer, then switch to it. The example runs the "
"whole flow: it lists the profiles, adds a second one, and switches the "
"active context to it."
msgstr ""
"Llista els teus perfils amb `aeat config profile list`, mira quin és "
"actiu, afegeix un segon contribuent i, tot seguit, canvia-hi. L'exemple "
"executa tot el flux: llista els perfils, n'afegeix un segon i hi canvia "
"el context actiu."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:36
msgid ""
"Logging in changes which local ledger, modelo drafts, and filing markers "
"`aeat app` commands use. The login verb is `aeat config login`, not `aeat"
" config profile login`."
msgstr ""
"Iniciar la sessió canvia quin ledger local, quins esborranys de modelo i "
"quins marcadors de presentació utilitzen les ordres `aeat app`. El verb "
"d'inici de sessió és `aeat config login`, no `aeat config profile login`."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:40
msgid ""
"Name the profile exactly. `aeat config login` accepts a profile UUID or "
"the exact label, and nothing else: a partial name, a different "
"capitalisation, or a shortened form is refused rather than guessed at. "
"Omit the name to log in to the profile already selected. The refusal is "
"deliberate - guessing which taxpayer you meant is how filings end up "
"under the wrong one."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:46
msgid ""
"Log out with `aeat config logout` when you finish. Logout closes the "
"storage session but keeps the profile selected for the next exact login; "
"it deletes nothing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:50
msgid "Decide your facts before you start"
msgstr "Decideix les teves dades abans de començar"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:52
msgid ""
"Profile setup asks a series of questions. Most are conditional: the "
"answers you give early decide which later questions appear. Decide these "
"facts first, and the rest of setup follows:"
msgstr ""
"La configuració del perfil fa una sèrie de preguntes. La majoria són "
"condicionals: les respostes que dones al principi decideixen quines "
"preguntes posteriors apareixen. Decideix primer aquestes dades i la resta"
" de la configuració ve tota sola:"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:56
msgid ""
"**Who the taxpayer is.** A natural person (an individual), a legal entity"
" (a company such as an SL or SA), or an attribution entity (a co-"
"ownership such as a *comunidad de bienes*, where income passes through to"
" its members)."
msgstr ""
"**Qui és el contribuent.** Una persona física (un particular), una "
"persona jurídica (una empresa com ara una SL o SA) o una entitat en "
"atribució (una cotitularitat com ara una *comunidad de bienes*, on la "
"renda es transmet als seus membres)."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:59
msgid ""
"**Which tax identifier applies.** Spanish citizens use their DNI as their"
" tax identifier (NIF). Foreign individuals use their NIE. Companies use a"
" NIF or CIF."
msgstr ""
"**Quin identificador tributari aplica.** Els ciutadans espanyols "
"utilitzen el seu DNI com a identificador tributari (NIF). Els particulars"
" estrangers utilitzen el seu NIE. Les empreses utilitzen un NIF o CIF."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:62
msgid ""
"**What the taxpayer does.** The economic activity and which kinds of "
"income apply: business or professional activity, salaried work, rental "
"income, investment income, capital gains, or a pension."
msgstr ""
"**Què fa el contribuent.** L'activitat econòmica i quins tipus de renda "
"apliquen: activitat empresarial o professional, treball assalariat, "
"rendes del lloguer, rendes d'inversió, guanys patrimonials o una pensió."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:65
msgid ""
"**Which VAT regime applies.** Value Added Tax (IVA) determines whether "
"the taxpayer charges and declares it, and how. The general regime files "
"IVA through Modelo 303."
msgstr ""
"**Quin règim d'IVA aplica.** L'Impost sobre el Valor Afegit (IVA) "
"determina si el contribuent el repercuteix i el declara, i com. El règim "
"general presenta l'IVA mitjançant el Modelo 303."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:68
msgid ""
"**Where the taxpayer is resident.** The autonomous community for a "
"Spanish resident, or the country of residence for a non-resident."
msgstr ""
"**On resideix el contribuent.** La comunitat autònoma per a un resident "
"espanyol, o el país de residència per a un no resident."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:70
msgid ""
"**Which output language you want.** The language `cadrumo` uses for its "
"output."
msgstr ""
"**Quin idioma de sortida vols.** L'idioma que utilitza `cadrumo` per a la"
" seva sortida."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:72
msgid ""
"You don't need to memorize flag names. The guided wizard walks you "
"through these decisions. For the complete, current list of flags and "
"their accepted values, run `aeat config profile create --help` and `aeat "
"config profile edit --help`:"
msgstr ""
"No cal que memoritzis els noms de les opcions. L'assistent guiat et porta"
" per aquestes decisions. Per obtenir la llista completa i actual "
"d'opcions i els seus valors acceptats, executa `aeat config profile "
"create --help` i `aeat config profile edit --help`:"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:80
msgid "Create your profile"
msgstr "Crea el teu perfil"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:82
msgid "Create a profile interactively, or non-interactively with flags."
msgstr "Crea un perfil de manera interactiva, o no interactiva amb opcions."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:84
msgid "Run the guided wizard when you're setting up a profile for the first time:"
msgstr "Executa l'assistent guiat quan configuris un perfil per primera vegada:"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:89
msgid ""
"The wizard is a full-page, question-by-question walk. Answer one page, "
"move to the next; go back to change an earlier answer at any time. The "
"first page asks for your output language. Answer it and the rest of the "
"wizard renders in the language you chose. The pages then walk your "
"identity, fiscal residence, economic activity, IVA, enrollment, family "
"situation (including your descendientes), recurring obligations, and "
"service preferences, ending on a review page that shows every answer "
"before anything is committed. Questions are conditional: the wizard only "
"asks what applies to the answers you already gave."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:98
msgid ""
"Each page explains its choices and shows the expected format for dates, "
"amounts, and identifiers, and refuses an invalid value on the spot. A "
"malformed date or tax identifier never reaches your stored profile."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:102
msgid ""
"The wizard prompts for your master-key passphrase before it stores "
"anything. For unattended runs, see [Run without a passphrase prompt"
"](protect-data-access.md#run-without-a-passphrase-prompt)."
msgstr ""
"L'assistent demana la teva contrasenya de clau mestra abans de desar res."
" Per a execucions desateses, consulta [Executa sense demanar la "
"contrasenya](protect-data-access.md#run-without-a-passphrase-prompt)."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:106
msgid ""
"Use `--language en`, `es`, `ca`, or `hu` for one command. A profile can "
"also store its default output language."
msgstr ""
"Fes servir `--language en`, `es`, `ca` o `hu` per a una ordre. Un perfil "
"també pot desar el seu idioma de sortida per defecte."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:110
msgid "Save now, finish later"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:112
msgid ""
"Stop a first-time setup at any point and keep what you answered. Choose "
"*save and exit* on any page: every answer you gave is already stored, and"
" the profile stays marked as setup-incomplete. `aeat config profile list`"
" flags an incomplete profile so you can spot it later."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:117
msgid ""
"Resume by running the same create command again with the same profile "
"name. The wizard picks up where you left off with your earlier answers in"
" place. Answer the remaining pages and confirm the review page to "
"complete setup. The profile then becomes active and ready for `aeat app` "
"commands."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:122
msgid ""
"Descendientes are the one exception on resume: the wizard asks for them "
"again so the set you confirm is always complete and current."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:125
msgid ""
"Use flags with `--quiet` when you want a repeatable, scriptable setup, "
"passing the entity type, tax id, name, and surnames to `aeat config "
"profile create`. The [worked example below](#worked-example-a-natural-"
"person-with-an-activity) runs a complete scripted create."
msgstr ""
"Fes servir opcions amb `--quiet` quan vulguis una configuració repetible "
"i apta per a scripts, passant el tipus d'entitat, l'identificador "
"tributari, el nom i els cognoms a `aeat config profile create`. "
"L'[exemple resolt de més avall](#worked-example-a-natural-person-with-an-"
"activity) executa una creació completa amb script."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:130
msgid ""
"`--quiet` runs without prompts and uses only the flags you provide. A "
"`--quiet` run refuses if a required flag is missing and tells you which "
"ones to add. A scripted create needs the filing identity: the tax "
"identifier, the entity type, and the name and surnames:"
msgstr ""
"`--quiet` s'executa sense indicacions i utilitza només les opcions que "
"proporciones. Una execució amb `--quiet` es nega si falta una opció "
"obligatòria i t'indica quines has d'afegir. Una creació amb script "
"necessita la identitat de presentació: l'identificador tributari, el "
"tipus d'entitat i el nom i els cognoms:"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:140
msgid ""
"Add `--accept-defaults` when you intentionally want Cadrumo to fill the "
"questions you omit from its built-in defaults."
msgstr ""
"Afegeix `--accept-defaults` quan vulguis intencionadament que Cadrumo "
"empleni les preguntes que ometis amb els seus valors per defecte "
"integrats."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:144
msgid "Worked example: a natural person with an activity"
msgstr "Exemple resolt: una persona física amb una activitat"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:146
msgid ""
"This example creates a natural-person profile for an individual with an "
"economic activity, then inspects and validates it before you rely on it:"
msgstr ""
"Aquest exemple crea un perfil de persona física per a un particular amb "
"una activitat econòmica, i després l'inspecciona i el valida abans de "
"refiar-te'n:"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:153
msgid "The facts setup asks for"
msgstr "Les dades que demana la configuració"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:155
msgid ""
"Setup groups its questions by decision area. These values are stable "
"command tokens: they're case-sensitive and don't translate. Run `aeat "
"config profile create --help` for the exhaustive flag list. It includes "
"the conditional spouse, family-unit, non-resident, and enrollment "
"questions this guide summarizes rather than repeats."
msgstr ""
"La configuració agrupa les seves preguntes per àrea de decisió. Aquests "
"valors són tokens d'ordre estables: distingeixen majúscules i minúscules "
"i no es tradueixen. Executa `aeat config profile create --help` per "
"obtenir la llista exhaustiva d'opcions. Inclou les preguntes condicionals"
" de cònjuge, unitat familiar, no resident i altes que aquesta guia "
"resumeix en lloc de repetir."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:161
msgid "Who the taxpayer is"
msgstr "Qui és el contribuent"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:163
msgid "Choose the entity type:"
msgstr "Tria el tipus d'entitat:"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:165
msgid "`natural_person` - an individual."
msgstr "`natural_person` - un particular."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:166
msgid ""
"`legal_entity` - a company. Record its legal form too, such as `sl`, "
"`sa`, or `cooperativa`."
msgstr ""
"`legal_entity` - una empresa. Registra'n també la forma jurídica, com ara"
" `sl`, `sa` o `cooperativa`."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:168
msgid ""
"`attribution_entity` - a co-ownership or community of goods whose income "
"is attributed to its members."
msgstr ""
"`attribution_entity` - una cotitularitat o comunidad de bienes la renda "
"de la qual s'atribueix als seus membres."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:171
msgid ""
"For a natural person, list each kind of income that applies, repeating "
"the flag once per category:"
msgstr ""
"Per a una persona física, llista cada tipus de renda que apliqui, "
"repetint l'opció una vegada per categoria:"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:174
msgid "`actividad_economica` - business or professional activity."
msgstr "`actividad_economica` - activitat empresarial o professional."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:175
msgid "`trabajo` - salaried employment."
msgstr "`trabajo` - treball assalariat."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:176
msgid "`capital_inmobiliario` - rental income from property."
msgstr "`capital_inmobiliario` - rendes del lloguer d'immobles."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:177
msgid "`capital_mobiliario` - investment income such as dividends or interest."
msgstr "`capital_mobiliario` - rendes d'inversió com ara dividends o interessos."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:178
msgid "`ganancias_patrimoniales` - capital gains."
msgstr "`ganancias_patrimoniales` - guanys patrimonials."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:179
msgid "`pension` - a retirement or disability pension."
msgstr "`pension` - una pensió de jubilació o d'incapacitat."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:181
msgid ""
"Choose `actividad_economica` only when the taxpayer runs an activity. A "
"pure landlord, a salaried-only taxpayer, or a pensioner with no activity "
"should not select it."
msgstr ""
"Tria `actividad_economica` només quan el contribuent duu a terme una "
"activitat. Un arrendador pur, un contribuent només assalariat o un "
"pensionista sense activitat no l'haurien de seleccionar."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:185
msgid ""
"For an activity, record how IRPF estimates its yield. Direct estimation "
"is the default and files Modelo 130. Use `--irpf-estimation-regime "
"objetiva` for the objective-estimation (módulos) regime, which files "
"Modelo 131 instead."
msgstr ""
"Per a una activitat, registra com l'IRPF n'estima el rendiment. "
"L'estimación directa és el valor per defecte i presenta el Modelo 130. "
"Fes servir `--irpf-estimation-regime objetiva` per al règim d'estimación "
"objetiva (módulos), que presenta el Modelo 131 en el seu lloc."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:189
msgid "Identity"
msgstr "Identitat"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:191
msgid ""
"The tax identifier (NIF, CIF, DNI, or NIE) is required. Spanish citizens "
"use their DNI as their NIF; foreign individuals use their NIE; companies "
"use a NIF or CIF. Record the name and surnames (or the entity's display "
"name), the economic activity when there is one, and the fiscal-address "
"postcode."
msgstr ""
"L'identificador tributari (NIF, CIF, DNI o NIE) és obligatori. Els "
"ciutadans espanyols utilitzen el seu DNI com a NIF; els particulars "
"estrangers utilitzen el seu NIE; les empreses utilitzen un NIF o CIF. "
"Registra el nom i els cognoms (o el nom visible de l'entitat), "
"l'activitat econòmica quan n'hi ha, i el codi postal del domicili fiscal."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:196
msgid "Where the taxpayer is resident"
msgstr "On resideix el contribuent"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:198
msgid ""
"For a Spanish IRPF (personal income tax) resident, set the autonomous "
"community (`--tax-residence-ccaa`), such as `madrid` or `cataluna`."
msgstr ""
"Per a un resident a efectes de l'IRPF espanyol, estableix la comunitat "
"autònoma (`--tax-residence-ccaa`), com ara `madrid` o `cataluna`."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:201
msgid ""
"This tool does not model the foral regimes. Setting the community to "
"`pais_vasco` or `navarra` is refused, because residents there file with "
"their *Hacienda Foral* under the *Concierto Económico*, not with the "
"AEAT:"
msgstr ""
"Aquesta eina no modela els règims forals. Establir la comunitat a "
"`pais_vasco` o `navarra` es rebutja, perquè els residents d'aquests "
"territoris presenten davant la seva *Hacienda Foral* sota el *Concierto "
"Económico*, no davant l'AEAT:"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:211
msgid ""
"For a non-resident, set `--fiscal-residency non_resident_irnr` (not "
"`--tax-residence-ccaa`), then supply the country of residence with "
"`--country-of-fiscal-residence` (an ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 code, such as "
"`DE`) and, when required, a fiscal representative with `--representante-"
"fiscal-nif` and `--representante-fiscal-nombre`."
msgstr ""
"Per a un no resident, estableix `--fiscal-residency non_resident_irnr` "
"(no `--tax-residence-ccaa`), després aporta el país de residència amb "
"`--country-of-fiscal-residence` (un codi ISO 3166-1 alfa-2, com ara `DE`)"
" i, quan calgui, un representant fiscal amb `--representante-fiscal-nif` "
"i `--representante-fiscal-nombre`."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:217
msgid "Which IVA regime applies"
msgstr "Quin règim d'IVA aplica"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:219
msgid "Set `--iva-regime` to the taxpayer's IVA regime:"
msgstr "Estableix `--iva-regime` al règim d'IVA del contribuent:"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:221
msgid "`GENERAL` - the standard regime; files quarterly IVA through Modelo 303."
msgstr ""
"`GENERAL` - el règim estàndard; presenta l'IVA trimestral mitjançant el "
"Modelo 303."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:222
msgid "`SIMPLIFICADO` - the simplified, module-based regime."
msgstr "`SIMPLIFICADO` - el règim simplificat basat en mòduls."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:223
msgid ""
"`RECARGO_EQUIVALENCIA` - the equivalence surcharge for qualifying "
"retailers."
msgstr ""
"`RECARGO_EQUIVALENCIA` - el recàrrec d'equivalència per als comerciants "
"minoristes que hi tenen dret."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:224
msgid "`REAGP` - the special regime for agriculture, livestock, and fishing."
msgstr "`REAGP` - el règim especial de l'agricultura, la ramaderia i la pesca."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:225
msgid "`EXENTO` - exempt activities, such as some education or healthcare."
msgstr ""
"`EXENTO` - activitats exemptes, com ara alguns serveis d'educació o "
"sanitat."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:227
msgid ""
"Record any IVA enrollments that apply, such as ROI (intra-community "
"operators) or OSS (one-stop-shop for cross-border B2C sales)."
msgstr ""
"Registra qualsevol alta d'IVA que apliqui, com ara el ROI (operadors "
"intracomunitaris) o l'OSS (finestreta única per a vendes B2C "
"transfrontereres)."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:230
msgid "Which recurring obligations apply"
msgstr "Quines obligacions recurrents apliquen"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:232
msgid ""
"These facts decide which forms the taxpayer must file. Record the ones "
"that are true:"
msgstr ""
"Aquestes dades decideixen quins formularis ha de presentar el "
"contribuent. Registra les que siguin certes:"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:235
msgid ""
"`--has-employees` or `--pays-professionals-with-retencion` - pays "
"salaries or professional fees with withholding."
msgstr ""
"`--has-employees` o `--pays-professionals-with-retencion` - paga salaris "
"o honoraris professionals amb retenció."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:237
msgid ""
"`--pays-rent-with-retencion` - pays business-premises rent with "
"withholding."
msgstr ""
"`--pays-rent-with-retencion` - paga el lloguer d'un local de negoci amb "
"retenció."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:238
msgid "`--does-intracomunitario` - trades with businesses in other EU countries."
msgstr ""
"`--does-intracomunitario` - fa operacions amb empreses d'altres països de"
" la UE."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:239
msgid ""
"`--third-party-transactions-above-347-threshold` - transactions with "
"third parties exceed the Modelo 347 threshold."
msgstr ""
"`--third-party-transactions-above-347-threshold` - les operacions amb "
"terceres persones superen el llindar del Modelo 347."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:241
msgid ""
"`--bienes-extranjero-above-threshold` - foreign assets exceed the legal "
"threshold."
msgstr ""
"`--bienes-extranjero-above-threshold` - els béns a l'estranger superen el"
" llindar legal."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:243
msgid ""
"`--art109-activity-income-withholding-ge-70pct` - the Art. 109 RIRPF 70 "
"percent income-coverage exception applies for covered professional, "
"agricultural, livestock, or forestry activity income. For activity "
"starts, record the coverage fact for the current payment period."
msgstr ""
"`--art109-activity-income-withholding-ge-70pct` - s'aplica l'excepció del"
" 70 per cent de cobertura d'ingressos de l'art. 109 del RIRPF per a "
"rendes d'activitat professional, agrícola, ramadera o forestal cobertes. "
"Per als inicis d'activitat, registra la dada de cobertura per al període "
"de pagament actual."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:248
msgid ""
"Leaving an obligation flag unset is not the same as marking it false. "
"When a fact is undeclared, the readiness check reports the related form "
"as *incomplete* (cannot determine), not *not applicable*. Record each "
"fact you know."
msgstr ""
"Deixar una opció d'obligació sense assignar no és el mateix que marcar-la"
" com a falsa. Quan una dada no està declarada, la comprovació de "
"preparació informa del formulari relacionat com a *incomplet* (no es pot "
"determinar), no com a *no aplicable*. Registra cada dada que coneguis."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:252
msgid "Check your facts before you calculate"
msgstr "Comprova les teves dades abans de calcular"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:254
msgid ""
"A wrong or missing fact produces a wrong filing. Confirm the profile "
"before you calculate a modelo. The example shows the active profile's "
"readiness summary and stored facts, validates them against the schema, "
"then checks whether the profile holds the facts a specific form needs for"
" a specific filing context:"
msgstr ""
"Una dada errònia o que falti produeix una presentació errònia. Confirma "
"el perfil abans de calcular un modelo. L'exemple mostra el resum de "
"preparació del perfil actiu i les dades desades, les valida contra "
"l'esquema i, tot seguit, comprova si el perfil conté les dades que un "
"formulari concret necessita per a un context de presentació concret:"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:263
msgid ""
"`preflight` names the missing fields for that `(modelo, filing-year, "
"period)` context. Use [Choose which modelo to file](choose-modelo.md) to "
"find the period codes a modelo accepts. Fix any wrong facts with `edit` "
"before you continue."
msgstr ""
"`preflight` anomena els camps que falten per a aquell context `(modelo, "
"any de presentació, període)`. Fes servir [Tria quin modelo presentar"
"](choose-modelo.md) per trobar els codis de període que accepta un "
"modelo. Corregeix qualsevol dada errònia amb `edit` abans de continuar."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:267
msgid "How your facts decide which forms apply"
msgstr "Com les teves dades decideixen quins formularis apliquen"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:269
msgid ""
"The profile facts you recorded determine which modelos the taxpayer must "
"file. Use this mapping to sanity-check your profile, then confirm a "
"specific form with `preflight`:"
msgstr ""
"Les dades del perfil que has registrat determinen quins modelos ha de "
"presentar el contribuent. Fes servir aquesta correspondència per fer una "
"comprovació de coherència del teu perfil i, tot seguit, confirma un "
"formulari concret amb `preflight`:"

