msgid ""
"For a scripted change, pass `--quiet` with only the flags you want to "
"change; every fact you don't name stays as it was."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:314
msgid "Manage your descendants"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:316
msgid ""
"Descendientes drive the *mínimo por descendientes* in the annual Renta. "
"Declare them during first-time setup; manage them afterwards with the "
"`descendiente` command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:320
msgid "Open the paged descendant editor:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:325
msgid ""
"The editor shows your declared descendientes, lets you change any answer,"
" add one, or reduce the count, and commits the complete set when you "
"confirm. Reducing the count removes the descendientes beyond it. The "
"stored set always matches exactly what you confirmed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:330
msgid "Script the same changes with the flag verbs:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:336
msgid ""
"`add` takes one `--descendiente` per child as `KEY=VALUE` pairs separated"
" by commas. `NACIMIENTO` (birth date, `AAAA-MM-DD`) is required; "
"`ADOPCION`, `DISCAPACIDAD` (`0`, `33`, or `65`), `CONVIVENCIA`, "
"`CUSTODIA`, `MESES_TRABAJO`, `GASTOS_GUARDERIA`, and `NIF` are optional. "
"A descendiente without a tax identifier is fine. Leave `NIF` out. "
"`remove` takes the position from `list`, counting from `0`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:343
msgid ""
"`MESES_TRABAJO` names *which* months the mother worked, not how many. "
"Write a month as two digits, a run as `MM-MM`, and separate entries with "
"`;`. Write `MESES_TRABAJO=05-08` for May to August. Write "
"`MESES_TRABAJO=01;03;09-12` for January, March, and September to "
"December."
msgstr ""
"`MESES_TRABAJO` anomena *quins* mesos va treballar la mare, no quants. "
"Escriviu el mes amb dos dígits, un interval com a `MM-MM`, i separeu les "
"entrades amb `;`. Escriviu `MESES_TRABAJO=05-08` per a maig a agost. "
"Escriviu `MESES_TRABAJO=01;03;09-12` per a gener, març i de setembre a "
"desembre."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:348
msgid ""
"Name the months. The guardería increment counts only the months the "
"mother worked *and* the child attended, so a count cannot say whether the"
" two overlap."
msgstr ""
"Anomeneu els mesos. L'increment per llar d'infants compta només els mesos"
" en què la mare va treballar *i* el menor hi va assistir, de manera que "
"un recompte no pot indicar si tots dos coincideixen."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:351
msgid "Maintain your profile"
msgstr "Manté el teu perfil"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:353
msgid ""
"The following steps edit a fact and back up the profile to a sealed "
"archive:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:359
msgid "What each step does:"
msgstr "Què fa cada pas:"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:361
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Edit** re-runs the wizard, or changes only the flags you pass with "
"`--quiet`. See [Modify your profile](#modify-your-profile). Run `show`, "
"`status`, or `validate` again after editing."
msgstr ""
"**Edit** canvia només les opcions que passes. Torna a executar `show`, "
"`status` o `validate` després d'editar."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:364
msgid ""
"**Archive export** writes a sealed, encrypted copy of the profile. The "
"target filename must end with `.cadrumo-bucket.tar.gz`. The archive is "
"encrypted with the profile passphrase and does not carry the profile "
"label. Restore it with `aeat config profile restore`, and read a sealed "
"archive's header without decrypting it using `aeat config profile archive"
" inspect`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:370
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Delete a profile for good with `aeat config profile delete NAME --yes`. "
"If the deleted profile was active, Cadrumo clears the active-profile "
"pointer."
msgstr ""
"**Delete** elimina un perfil per sempre. Si el perfil eliminat era "
"l'actiu, Cadrumo esborra el punter del perfil actiu."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:373
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A sealed archive contains taxpayer data, including the tax identifier, "
"activity, and local filing history. Store it as sensitive tax data, and "
"don't attach it to a support request. See [import, export, and "
"evidence](../reference/import-export-and-evidence.md)."
msgstr ""
"Un fitxer de perfil portable conté dades del contribuent, inclosos "
"l'identificador tributari, l'activitat i l'historial de presentacions "
"local. Desa'l com a dada tributària sensible i no l'adjuntis a una "
"sol·licitud d'ajuda tret que n'hagis eliminat les dades personals."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:378
msgid ""
"Sign out without deleting the profile using `aeat config logout`. Logout "
"closes the active storage session, discards its in-memory keys, disposes "
"the bucket engines, and clears the local active-profile pointer:"
msgstr ""
"Tanca la sessió sense eliminar el perfil amb `aeat config logout`. El "
"tancament de sessió tanca la sessió d'emmagatzematge activa, descarta les"
" seves claus en memòria, elimina els motors de bucket i esborra el punter"
" local del perfil actiu:"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:386
msgid "Choose your service capabilities"
msgstr "Tria les capacitats de servei"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:388
msgid ""
"Each profile carries its own opt-in for three optional services. The "
"setup wizard asks these questions when you create or edit a profile, and "
"you can change them at any time. These steps show the current posture, "
"turn one capability off, then show the posture again:"
msgstr ""
"Cada perfil porta la seva pròpia acceptació per a tres serveis opcionals."
" L'assistent de configuració fa aquestes preguntes quan crees o edites un"
" perfil, i les pots canviar en qualsevol moment. Aquests passos mostren "
"la postura actual, desactiven una capacitat i tornen a mostrar la "
"postura:"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:397
msgid "The three capabilities are:"
msgstr "Les tres capacitats són:"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:399
msgid ""
"`cloud_evidence_upload` - allow sending sensitive evidence to a cloud LLM"
" provider. Off by default. Barred for gestor profiles."
msgstr ""
"`cloud_evidence_upload` - permet enviar evidència sensible a un proveïdor"
" d'LLM al núvol. Desactivat per defecte. Vedat per als perfils de gestor."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:401
msgid "`llm_vision` - read invoices with the on-host vision model. On by default."
msgstr ""
"`llm_vision` - llegeix factures amb el model de visió local. Activat per "
"defecte."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:402
msgid "`google_export` - export calculations to Google Sheets. On by default."
msgstr "`google_export` - exporta càlculs a Google Sheets. Activat per defecte."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:404
msgid ""
"Turn any capability on or off with `aeat config profile capabilities "
"set`. The example turns `llm_vision` off. Pass `cloud_evidence_upload on`"
" to enable cloud upload. Missing package extras produce the exact install"
" command. See [Install Cadrumo](../workstation-setup.md) for the extras."
msgstr ""
"Activa o desactiva qualsevol capacitat amb `aeat config profile "
"capabilities set`. L'exemple desactiva `llm_vision`. Passa "
"`cloud_evidence_upload on` per habilitar la pujada al núvol. Els extres "
"de paquet que faltin produeixen l'ordre d'instal·lació exacta. Consulta "
"[Instal·la Cadrumo](../workstation-setup.md) per als extres."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:409
msgid "See what changed"
msgstr "Mira què ha canviat"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:411
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Every change to a profile - creation, edits, imports, classifications, "
"calculations, and filings - is recorded as an event in that profile's "
"append-only history (a log you can read but not alter). Reading history "
"needs an active profile, so switch to it first after logout. The example "
"creates, renames, and edits a profile before filtering its history:"
msgstr ""
"Cada canvi a un perfil -creació, edicions, importacions, classificacions,"
" càlculs i presentacions- es registra com un esdeveniment a l'historial "
"només d'afegit d'aquell perfil (un registre que pots llegir però no "
"alterar). Llegir l'historial necessita un perfil actiu, així que canvia-"
"hi primer després de tancar la sessió. L'exemple crea, canvia de nom i "
"edita un perfil abans de navegar i filtrar el seu historial:"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:421
msgid ""
"Repeat `--event-type` to include several types. An unknown type is "
"refused with the full accepted list, so an empty value is a quick way to "
"discover the vocabulary."
msgstr ""
"Repeteix `--event-type` per incloure diversos tipus. Un tipus desconegut "
"es rebutja amb la llista acceptada completa, de manera que un valor buit "
"és una manera ràpida de descobrir el vocabulari."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:425
msgid ""
"A rename appears as two events on purpose: `profile.renamed` records that"
" the data changed, and `bucket.renamed` records that you ran the rename "
"action. One answers \"what changed\", the other \"what was done\"."
msgstr ""
"Un canvi de nom apareix com a dos esdeveniments a propòsit: "
"`profile.renamed` registra que les dades han canviat, i `bucket.renamed` "
"registra que has executat l'acció de canvi de nom. L'un respon «què ha "
"canviat» i l'altre «què s'ha fet»."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:429
msgid "If setup looks wrong"
msgstr "Si la configuració sembla incorrecta"

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:431
msgid ""
"If a command reports no active profile, an invalid field value, or that "
"you're working under the wrong profile, see [Diagnose and repair your "
"local setup](troubleshooting.md)."
msgstr ""
"Si una ordre informa que no hi ha cap perfil actiu, d'un valor de camp no"
" vàlid, o que estàs treballant sota el perfil incorrecte, consulta "
"[Diagnostica i repara la teva configuració local](troubleshooting.md)."

#: ../../how-to/profile-setup.md:435
msgid ""
"When the troubleshooting steps don't resolve it, follow [Prepare a "
"privacy-safe support request](troubleshooting.md#prepare-a-privacy-safe-"
"support-request). It names the outputs to include and the personal data "
"to leave out before you take the issue to the project's issue tracker."
msgstr ""
"Quan els passos de resolució de problemes no ho resolen, segueix [Prepara"
" una sol·licitud d'ajuda segura per a la "
"privadesa](troubleshooting.md#prepare-a-privacy-safe-support-request). "
"Anomena les sortides que has d'incloure i les dades personals que has de "
"deixar fora abans de portar el problema al seguidor d'incidències del "
"projecte."

